RDNA3-Hackintosh - third-party components and permissions

third_party/amd/        Verbatim or extracted headers from the Linux kernel
                        amdgpu driver (drivers/gpu/drm/amd, include/uapi/drm).
                        Copyright Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. and others,
                        MIT licence (text kept at the top of every file).

common/, kext/          Ports of logic from Linux amdgpu (MIT). Files that port
                        a specific amdgpu source name it in their header.

hw/gen/*13_0_7*.h       SMU 13.0.7 ABI headers from Linux v6.12,
                        drivers/gpu/drm/amd/pm/swsmu/inc/{pmfw_if/,}.
                        Copyright 2022 Advanced Micro Devices, Inc. (MIT);
                        original permission text retained in each header.

NullMoth NVIDIA driver  https://github.com/nullmoth/nvidia-macos-driver
                        (plugin/, kexts/: PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0,
                        translator/: LGPL-3.0-or-later, nvk/: MIT).
                        RDNA3-Hackintosh is a private, non-commercial project
                        and is never sold, so the code derived from NullMoth
                        is used under PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0 as written
                        (metal/LICENSE.PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0); anyone
                        who takes it from this repository is bound by the same
                        licence. In addition, the NullMoth author told this
                        project on the NullMoth Discord (October 2026) that the
                        code may be used in any way for AMD GPUs as long as it
                        does not interfere with NullMoth's NVIDIA work; the
                        derived code here therefore stays AMD-only.
                        In this repository: accel/ (NullMoth accelerator),
                        fb/ (derived from NVRMFB), agdc/ (derived from
                        NVRMAGDC), metal/ (plugin, translator).
                        The translator keeps its LGPL-3.0-or-later licence.

Navi48-MacOS            https://github.com/Almosst-DEV/Navi48-MacOS by
                        Almosst-DEV, commit d1f7bad, src/navi48-bringup
                        (BSD-3-Clause, text below). agdc/rdna3_agdc_n48.h
                        takes the AGDC reply layouts of its
                        src/apple/display_pipe_guard.h (the 0x711 inline-buffer
                        entry, the zero-filled capability types, the 0x921
                        flags without bit 0, the AMD plane-scaler markers);
                        the code is this project's own. Nothing is taken from
                        its third-party/metal2vulkan-n48 (LGPL-3.0).

